- grade and/or 

- iii. performance in the interview for the grade and/or 

- iv. any other measure of performance so prescribed by the Authority; 

- (w) **“Officer”** means Class I Officer referred to in these Regulations; 

- (x) **“Other employee”** means other than Class I Officer; 

- (y) **“Pay”** means the amount drawn by an employee as 

- i. basic pay which is sanctioned for a post held by him substantively to which he is entitled by reason of his position in a grade; 

- ii. special allowance and personal allowance; 

- iii. grade allowance; 

